）"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）1300或1300.0（1分）a（1分）1.0（2分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9406e2203e87eb387a30b5982e996cc153219163ae8e3bebbc5d795b3ce1b568","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （8分）导热良好的圆筒形容器水平放置，用横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S = 0.01 \\, \\text{m}^2"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光滑活塞密封了一定质量的理想气体，如图甲所示，活塞到底面的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 为 "},{"type":"math","value":"102 \\, \\text{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现在将容器缓慢转到竖直，如图乙所示，此时活塞到底面的距离变为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_2 = 100 \\, \\text{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。设大气压 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_0 = 1.0 \\times 10^5 \\, \\text{pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，热力学温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" 与摄氏温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" 的关系取 "},{"type":"math","value":"T = t + 273 \\, (\\text{K})"},{"type":"text","value":" ，重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10 \\, \\text{m/s}^2"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）求活塞的质量\n（2）若原先的环境温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"27^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，现在要通过改变环境温度使活塞回到原先的位置，则\n①应使环境温度变为多少？\n②理想气体的内能与温度的关系为 U=aT，此理想气体 a=25J/K，在（2）所述过程中气体是吸热还是放热？传递的热量是多少？\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6dbc8c6c83bb722e4d932853f841ab59721edc407dc1b061f42f8aa2b3ebab48.png","width":251,"height":185,"width_mm":29.401,"row_group":"gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8eedfaab66a4b587e75e9d72fd936f239596dcf90cffd5ea33de17a3a95919da.png","width":184,"height":254,"width_mm":21.421,"row_group":"gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图\n乙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（8分）【解析】\n（1）从水平到竖直，等温变化："},{"type":"math","value":"P_{0}L_{1}S = (P_{0} + \\frac{mg}{S})L_{2}S"},{"type":"text","value":"2分代入数据可得："},{"type":"math","value":"m = 2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n（2）①活塞回复过程中气体压强不变，由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{L_{2}S}{T_{2}}=\\frac{L_{1}S}{T_{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"代入数据可得："},{"type":"math","value":"T_{3}=306K"},{"type":"text","value":"2分\n②活塞回复过程中气体对外做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W = p \\Delta V = (P_0 + \\frac{mg}{S})(L_2 - L_1) S = -20.4 J"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n气体的内能变化"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = a\\Delta T = 25\\times (306 - 300) = 150\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"由热力学第一定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n代入数据得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 170.4\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"即气体是吸热170.4J 1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8d5a3cec89e6f7f8937867d7de2275bbca2f47f1d68c68e36b98be790183aa66","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （11分）如图所示，在同一竖直平面内，有倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的粗糙斜面 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" ，粗糙水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" ，竖直光滑圆轨道（最低点略微错开），圆轨道右侧是光滑轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" ，连接处均平滑。小车紧靠平台停在光滑水平地面上，上表面为1/4光滑圆弧 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小车 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 点切线水平与轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 等高。从斜面上 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点静止释放一小物块（可视为质点），小物块能沿着轨道运动并滑上小车。已知小物块与斜面 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 、轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 间的动摩擦因数均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，(已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" ，重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" )，斜面长 "},{"type":"math","value":"s = 25\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 3.6\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，圆轨道半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小物块质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 1\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小车质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 7\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 点距地面高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"H = 0.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。求：\n（1）小物块从 A 运动到 B 的时间；\n（2）小物块到圆轨道最高点时对轨道的压力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）小物块离开小车落到地面上时与小车左端 E 点的水平距离 x （假设小物块落地后不反弹）.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2a631656eab097a1ee8cef27068e4c83e61dc3e8c2e91d697dc35f49eb045967.png","width":1003,"height":297,"width_mm":117.815,"row_group":"gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（11分）【解析】\n（1）根据牛顿第二定律，小物体沿传送带下滑的加速度为："},{"type":"math","value":"a_{1} = \\frac{m g \\sin \\theta - \\mu m g \\cos \\theta}{m} = 2 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n小物体从 A 端运动到 B 端做初速度为零的匀加速直线运动，设需要的时间为 t，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"s=\\frac{1}{2}a_{1}t_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2s}{a_{1}}}=5s"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n（2）到 B 点的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v=a_{1}t_{1}=10\\ \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"点到最高点过程有"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu mgL - mg2R = \\frac{1}{2} mv_1^2 -\\frac{1}{2} mv^2"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n滑块运动到最高点有"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}+mg=m\\frac{v_{1}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n由牛顿第三定律可知"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=F_{N}'=14N"},{"type":"text","value":"方向竖直向上 1 分\n（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu mgL = \\frac{1}{2} mv_2^2 - \\frac{1}{2} mv^2"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_2 = mv_3 + Mv_4"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} mv_2^2 = \\frac{1}{2} mv_3^2 + \\frac{1}{2} Mv_4^2"},{"type":"text","value":"联立解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_3 = -6\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_4 = 2\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"2分\n小物块离开小车做平抛运动\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{1}{2}gt_2^2"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2 = 0.2\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{x} = (v_{4} - v_{3})t_{2} = 1.6\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f7399c533e1d92e4cfa496cf882ca1673dc341db2dbc48a2b3f3e19d6e05b0a0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19. （11分）如图所示，平行金属导轨倾斜放置，倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，导轨间距离为L。导轨顶端接有电阻R，下端G、H处通过绝缘材料与足够长的水平导轨平滑连接，水平导轨间距也为L，其右端接有电容为C的电容器。斜轨道EF的下方及水平轨道处均有方向竖直向下的匀强磁场，磁感应强度均为B。质量为m、长度为L、电阻为r的导体棒ab垂直倾斜导轨放置，与磁场边界EF的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现将导体棒ab由静止释放，已知导体棒到达斜轨道底部前已匀速，EF离倾斜导轨底端距离为x。已知B=1T，L=1m， "},{"type":"math","value":"R=4\\Omega,\\quad r=2\\Omega,\\quad m=0.08kg,\\quad x_{0}=0.75m,\\quad x=3.6m,\\quad C=0.1F"},{"type":"text","value":" ，当电容器电压为U时，电容器储存的电场能为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{1}{2}CU^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。不计一切摩擦，不考虑电磁辐射，导体棒始终与导轨接触且垂直。（已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^{\\circ}=0.6,\\quad\\cos37^{\\circ}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" ，重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）求：\n（1）导体棒刚进入磁场时 ab 两端的电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）导体棒在倾斜导轨上运动的时间 t;\n（3）在整个过程中导体棒 ab 上产生的焦耳热 Q.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a2e53e4c747a8fbcd5e64051f4bbf1be51d1cfe0ec4f9c6370e6ce87988e994a.png","width":655,"height":316,"width_mm":76.863,"row_group":"gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 19 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"19.（11分）【解析】\n（1）导体棒进入磁场前，做匀加速直线运动"},{"type":"math","value":"a=g\\sin\\theta=6m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"进入磁场时速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\sqrt{2ax_{0}}=3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n所以，ab两端电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}=\\frac{R}{R+r}BLv\\cos\\theta=1.6V"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n（2）进入磁场前运动"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{v_{1}}{a}=0.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n匀速时，有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{B^{2}L^{2}v_{2}(\\cos\\theta)^{2}}{R+r}=mg\\sin\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=4.5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\theta\\cdot t_{2}-\\frac{B^{2}L^{2}(\\cos\\theta)^{2}x}{R+r}=mv_{2}-mv_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=1.05s"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n总时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t=t_{1}+t_{2}=1.55s"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n（3）在斜轨道上运动时ab棒上产生的焦耳热"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1} = \\frac{r}{r + R}\\left[mg(x_{0} + x) - \\frac{1}{2} mv_{2}^{2}\\right] = 0.426J"},{"type":"text","value":"1分导体棒在水平轨道上先减速后匀速，设匀速时速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"，有"},{"type":"math","value":"BLv_{3} = \\frac{q}{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"-BLq = mv_{3} - mv_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{3} = 2m / s \\quad q = 0.2C"},{"type":"text","value":"电容器两端电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U = \\frac{q}{C} = 2V"},{"type":"text","value":"由能量守恒可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} mv_{2}^{2} - \\frac{1}{2} mv_{3}^{2} = \\frac{1}{2} CU^{2} + Q_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{2} = 0.45J"},{"type":"text","value":"1分整个过程中ab棒上的焦耳热"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = Q_{1} + Q_{2} = 0.876J"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-9-1-lianmeng-2411-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"eed111815be24f52b2e20d044be3a320786ef9a7b1b2ce4cc132bdb9c355f63e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（11分）如图所示，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"xoy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面内有一以 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 为圆心，半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆形磁场区域I，磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" （未知）。在圆形磁场区域右侧放置水平极板 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其中心线 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}O_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 在 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴上，极板长度和极板间距离均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1} = 2R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，极板间接有偏转电场的电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{\\mathrm{MN}}"},{"type":"text","value":" （未知）。位于 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的粒子源沿纸面内向圆形磁场区域内各个方向均匀发射速率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的带电粒子，粒子质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"+q"},{"type":"text","value":" ，单位时间内放出的粒子数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":" 。所有粒子经圆形磁场偏转后均沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向。其中沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向入射的粒子从 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 点出磁场，并经过偏转电场后刚好从下极板的边缘飞出，打在下极板上的粒子立即被吸收，并通过电流表导入大地。距离极板 MN 右端 "},{"type":